        "original_id": "1676060e-f5ab-5ee7-8bee-8a8a4989e192",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Líneas Aéreas Privadas Argentinas, Aerolíneas Argentinas, Austral Líneas Aéreas, Cielos del Sur S.A.\n- Topics: Argentine airline market competition, domestic airlines in Argentina\n\nFacts:\n- Líneas Aéreas Privadas Argentinas was the first carrier to break a monopolistic Argentine airline market controlled by Aerolíneas Argentinas and Austral Líneas Aéreas.\n- Líneas Aéreas Privadas Argentinas offered competitive prices in the Argentine airline market.\n- Cielos del Sur S.A. operates as Austral Líneas Aéreas.\n- Austral Líneas Aéreas is more commonly known as Austral.\n- Austral Líneas Aéreas is a domestic airline of Argentina.\n- Austral Líneas Aéreas is the sister company of Aerolíneas Argentinas.",
